flowchart LR
    User[User] -->|Explicit permission| Camera[Webcam video stream]
    Camera --> Preview[Mirrored video preview]
    Camera --> Vision[MediaPipe Tasks Vision]
    Vision --> Model[Pretrained hand_landmarker.task]
    Vision --> Landmarks[21 landmarks and handedness]
    Landmarks --> Gesture[Debounced gesture geometry]
    Landmarks --> Stabilizer[Adaptive speed-aware smoothing]
    Stabilizer --> Mapper[Mirror, aspect-ratio and canvas mapping]
    Mapper --> Drawing[Canvas drawing engine]
    Pointer[Mouse and touch fallback] --> Drawing
    Sim[Clearly labeled simulated coordinates] --> Gesture
    Sim --> Stabilizer
    Gesture --> Drawing
    Drawing --> History[Stroke history and undo/redo]
    History --> Artwork[Independent artwork layer]
    Artwork --> PNG[Transparent PNG exporter]
    History --> IDB[IndexedDB artwork library]
